  "notebook": {
    "id": "default",
    "name": "Tidyverse দিয়ে ডেটা র‍্যাংগলিং ও প্রক্রিয়াকরণ",
    "autoNameNumber": null,
    "description": "",
    "kernelLanguage": "python",
    "catalogId": null,
    "catalogRevision": null,
    "cellCounter": 17,
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "code": "# Tidyverse দিয়ে ডেটা র‍্যাংগলিং ও প্রক্রিয়াকরণ\n\nবহুভাষিক ডেটা পাইপলাইন: Python ডেটা ডাউনলোড করে → R তা dplyr দিয়ে প্রসেস করে → Python ফলাফল ভিজ্যুয়ালাইজ করে।\n\n**SharedVFS** প্রদর্শন করে — যা একটি শেয়ার করা ফাইল সিস্টেম এবং Python ও R-কে ফাইল আদান-প্রদান করতে দেয়।",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "code": "## ১. Python: ডেটাসেট ডাউনলোড করুন",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "code": "import micropip\nawait micropip.install('pandas')\nimport pandas as pd, pyodide.http, os\n\nurl = \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/resbaz/r-novice-gapminder-files/master/data/gapminder-FiveYearData.csv\"\nresp = await pyodide.http.pyfetch(url)\ntext = await resp.string()\n\nos.makedirs(\"/shared/data\", exist_ok=True)\nwith open(\"/shared/data/gapminder.csv\", \"w\") as f:\n    f.write(text)\n\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"/shared/data/gapminder.csv\")\nprint(f\"ডাউনলোড করা হয়েছে: {df.shape[0]} টি সারি, {df.shape[1]} টি কলাম\")\ndf.head()",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "python",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "ডাউনলোড করা হয়েছে: 1704 টি সারি, 6 টি কলাম\n       country  year         pop continent  lifeExp   gdpPercap\n0  Afghanistan  1952   8425333.0      Asia   28.801  779.445314\n1  Afghanistan  1957   9240934.0      Asia   30.332  820.853030\n2  Afghanistan  1962  10267083.0      Asia   31.997  853.100710\n3  Afghanistan  1967  11537966.0      Asia   34.020  836.197138\n4  Afghanistan  1972  13079460.0      Asia   36.088  739.981106",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">ডাউনলোড করা হয়েছে: 1704 টি সারি, 6 টি কলাম\n</pre><pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">       country  year         pop continent  lifeExp   gdpPercap\n0  Afghanistan  1952   8425333.0      Asia   28.801  779.445314\n1  Afghanistan  1957   9240934.0      Asia   30.332  820.853030\n2  Afghanistan  1962  10267083.0      Asia   31.997  853.100710\n3  Afghanistan  1967  11537966.0      Asia   34.020  836.197138\n4  Afghanistan  1972  13079460.0      Asia   36.088  739.981106</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "code": "## ২. R: dplyr + tidyr ইনস্টল করুন এবং শেয়ার করা ডেটা পড়ুন",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "code": "install.packages(c(\"dplyr\", \"tidyr\"))\nlibrary(dplyr)\n\ngap <- read.csv(\"/shared/data/gapminder.csv\")\ncat(\"SharedVFS থেকে পড়া হয়েছে:\", nrow(gap), \"সারি\\n\")\nglimpse(gap)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "SharedVFS থেকে পড়া হয়েছে: 1704 সারি\nRows: 1,704\nColumns: 6\n$ country   <chr> \"Afghanistan\", \"Afghanistan\", \"Afghanistan\", \"Afghanistan\", …\n$ year      <int> 1952, 1957, 1962, 1967, 1972, 1977, 1982, 1987, 1992, 1997, …\n$ pop       <dbl> 8425333, 9240934, 10267083, 11537966, 13079460, 14880372, 12…\n$ continent <chr> \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asi…\n$ lifeExp   <dbl> 28.801, 30.332, 31.997, 34.020, 36.088, 38.438, 39.854, 40.8…\n$ gdpPercap <dbl> 779.4453, 820.8530, 853.1007, 836.1971, 739.9811, 786.1134, …",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">SharedVFS থেকে পড়া হয়েছে: 1704 সারি\nRows: 1,704\nColumns: 6\n$ country   &lt;chr&gt; \"Afghanistan\", \"Afghanistan\", \"Afghanistan\", \"Afghanistan\", …\n$ year      &lt;int&gt; 1952, 1957, 1962, 1967, 1972, 1977, 1982, 1987, 1992, 1997, …\n$ pop       &lt;dbl&gt; 8425333, 9240934, 10267083, 11537966, 13079460, 14880372, 12…\n$ continent &lt;chr&gt; \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asia\", \"Asi…\n$ lifeExp   &lt;dbl&gt; 28.801, 30.332, 31.997, 34.020, 36.088, 38.438, 39.854, 40.8…\n$ gdpPercap &lt;dbl&gt; 779.4453, 820.8530, 853.1007, 836.1971, 739.9811, 786.1134, …</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "code": "## ৩. dplyr: মহাদেশ অনুযায়ী সারসংক্ষেপ (2007)",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "code": "gap %>%\n  filter(year == 2007) %>%\n  group_by(continent) %>%\n  summarize(\n    countries = n(),\n    mean_life = round(mean(lifeExp), 1),\n    median_gdp = round(median(gdpPercap), 0),\n    total_pop = sum(as.numeric(pop))\n  ) %>%\n  arrange(desc(mean_life))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "# A tibble: 5 × 5\n  continent countries mean_life median_gdp  total_pop\n  <chr>         <int>     <dbl>      <dbl>      <dbl>\n1 Oceania           2      80.7      29810   24549947\n2 Europe           30      77.6      28054  586098529\n3 Americas         25      73.6       8948  898871184\n4 Asia             33      70.7       4471 3811953827\n5 Africa           52      54.8       1452  929539692",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\"># A tibble: 5 × 5\n  continent countries mean_life median_gdp  total_pop\n  &lt;chr&gt;         &lt;int&gt;     &lt;dbl&gt;      &lt;dbl&gt;      &lt;dbl&gt;\n1 Oceania           2      80.7      29810   24549947\n2 Europe           30      77.6      28054  586098529\n3 Americas         25      73.6       8948  898871184\n4 Asia             33      70.7       4471 3811953827\n5 Africa           52      54.8       1452  929539692</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "code": "## ৪. dplyr: গড় আয়ুতে সবচেয়ে বড় বৃদ্ধি",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "code": "gains <- gap %>%\n  filter(year %in% c(1952, 2007)) %>%\n  select(country, continent, year, lifeExp) %>%\n  tidyr::pivot_wider(names_from = year, values_from = lifeExp,\n                     names_prefix = \"y\") %>%\n  mutate(gain = y2007 - y1952) %>%\n  arrange(desc(gain)) %>%\n  head(10)\ngains",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "# A tibble: 10 × 5\n   country            continent y1952 y2007  gain\n   <chr>              <chr>     <dbl> <dbl> <dbl>\n 1 Oman               Asia       37.6  75.6  38.1\n 2 Vietnam            Asia       40.4  74.2  33.8\n 3 Indonesia          Asia       37.5  70.6  33.2\n 4 Saudi Arabia       Asia       39.9  72.8  32.9\n 5 Libya              Africa     42.7  74.0  31.2\n 6 Korea Rep.         Asia       47.5  78.6  31.2\n 7 Nicaragua          Americas   42.3  72.9  30.6\n 8 West Bank and Gaza Asia       43.2  73.4  30.3\n 9 Yemen Rep.         Asia       32.5  62.7  30.2\n10 Gambia             Africa     30    59.4  29.4",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\"># A tibble: 10 × 5\n   country            continent y1952 y2007  gain\n   &lt;chr&gt;              &lt;chr&gt;     &lt;dbl&gt; &lt;dbl&gt; &lt;dbl&gt;\n 1 Oman               Asia       37.6  75.6  38.1\n 2 Vietnam            Asia       40.4  74.2  33.8\n 3 Indonesia          Asia       37.5  70.6  33.2\n 4 Saudi Arabia       Asia       39.9  72.8  32.9\n 5 Libya              Africa     42.7  74.0  31.2\n 6 Korea Rep.         Asia       47.5  78.6  31.2\n 7 Nicaragua          Americas   42.3  72.9  30.6\n 8 West Bank and Gaza Asia       43.2  73.4  30.3\n 9 Yemen Rep.         Asia       32.5  62.7  30.2\n10 Gambia             Africa     30    59.4  29.4</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "code": "## ৫. dplyr: মহাদেশ অনুযায়ী জনসংখ্যা বৃদ্ধি",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "code": "pop_growth <- gap %>%\n  filter(year %in% c(1952, 2007)) %>%\n  group_by(continent, year) %>%\n  summarize(total_pop = sum(as.numeric(pop)), .groups = \"drop\") %>%\n  tidyr::pivot_wider(names_from = year, values_from = total_pop,\n                     names_prefix = \"pop_\") %>%\n  mutate(growth_pct = round((pop_2007 / pop_1952 - 1) * 100, 1)) %>%\n  arrange(desc(growth_pct))\npop_growth",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "# A tibble: 5 × 4\n  continent    pop_1952   pop_2007 growth_pct\n  <chr>           <dbl>      <dbl>      <dbl>\n1 Africa     237640501   929539692      291. \n2 Asia      1395357352. 3811953827      173. \n3 Americas   345152446   898871184      160. \n4 Oceania     10686006    24549947      130. \n5 Europe     418120846   586098529       40.2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\"># A tibble: 5 × 4\n  continent    pop_1952   pop_2007 growth_pct\n  &lt;chr&gt;           &lt;dbl&gt;      &lt;dbl&gt;      &lt;dbl&gt;\n1 Africa     237640501   929539692      291. \n2 Asia      1395357352. 3811953827      173. \n3 Americas   345152446   898871184      160. \n4 Oceania     10686006    24549947      130. \n5 Europe     418120846   586098529       40.2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "code": "## ৬. R: ফলাফল SharedVFS-এ লিখুন",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "code": "# Python-এ ভিজ্যুয়ালাইজ করার জন্য মহাদেশের সারসংক্ষেপ লিখুন\nsummary_2007 <- gap %>%\n  filter(year == 2007) %>%\n  group_by(continent) %>%\n  summarize(\n    mean_life = round(mean(lifeExp), 1),\n    mean_gdp = round(mean(gdpPercap), 0),\n    .groups = \"drop\"\n  )\nwrite.csv(summary_2007, \"/shared/data/r_summary.csv\", row.names = FALSE)\ncat(\"/shared/data/r_summary.csv ফাইলটি লেখা হয়েছে\\n\")\nsummary_2007",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "/shared/data/r_summary.csv ফাইলটি লেখা হয়েছে\n# A tibble: 5 × 3\n  continent mean_life mean_gdp\n  <chr>         <dbl>    <dbl>\n1 Africa         54.8     3089\n2 Americas       73.6    11003\n3 Asia           70.7    12473\n4 Europe         77.6    25054\n5 Oceania        80.7    29810",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">/shared/data/r_summary.csv ফাইলটি লেখা হয়েছে\n# A tibble: 5 × 3\n  continent mean_life mean_gdp\n  &lt;chr&gt;         &lt;dbl&gt;    &lt;dbl&gt;\n1 Africa         54.8     3089\n2 Americas       73.6    11003\n3 Asia           70.7    12473\n4 Europe         77.6    25054\n5 Oceania        80.7    29810</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "code": "## ৭. Python: R-এর ফলাফল ভিজ্যুয়ালাইজ করুন",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "code": "import micropip\nawait micropip.install('plotly')\nimport plotly.express as px\nimport json, js\nfrom plotly.utils import PlotlyJSONEncoder\n\ndef plain_plotly(value):\n    if hasattr(value, 'tolist'):\n        return value.tolist()\n    if isinstance(value, dict):\n        return {key: plain_plotly(item) for key, item in value.items()}\n    if isinstance(value, (list, tuple)):\n        return [plain_plotly(item) for item in value]\n    return value\n\ndef show_plotly(fig):\n    payload = plain_plotly(fig.to_plotly_json())\n    js.renderPlot(json.dumps({\"traces\": payload[\"data\"], \"layout\": payload[\"layout\"]}, cls=PlotlyJSONEncoder))\n\nr_summary = pd.read_csv(\"/shared/data/r_summary.csv\")\nprint(\"SharedVFS থেকে পড়া হয়েছে (R দ্বারা লিখিত):\")\nprint(r_summary.to_string(index=False))\n\nfig = px.bar(r_summary, x=\"continent\", y=\"mean_life\",\n             title=\"মহাদেশ অনুযায়ী গড় আয়ু (২০০৭) — R → Python থেকে\",\n             labels={\"mean_life\": \"গড় আয়ু (বছর)\", \"continent\": \"মহাদেশ\"},\n             color=\"continent\")\nfig.update_layout(template='plotly_dark', showlegend=False)\nshow_plotly(fig)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "python",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "AfricaAmericasAsiaEuropeOceania020406080মহাদেশ অনুযায়ী গড় আয়ু (২০০৭) — R → Python থেকেমহাদেশগড় আয়ু (বছর)SharedVFS থেকে পড়া হয়েছে (R দ্বারা লিখিত):\ncontinent  mean_life  mean_gdp\n   Africa       54.8      3089\n Americas       73.6     11003\n     Asia       70.7     12473\n   Europe       77.6     25054\n  Oceania       80.7     29810\n",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<div class=\"plot-container js-plotly-plot\"><div class=\"plot-container plotly\"><div class=\"user-select-none svg-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%;\"><svg class=\"main-svg\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"654\" height=\"250\" style=\"background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"><defs id=\"defs-83f037\"><g class=\"clips\"><clipPath id=\"clip83f037xyplot\" class=\"plotclip\"><rect width=\"583\" height=\"167\"></rect></clipPath><clipPath class=\"axesclip\" id=\"clip83f037x\"><rect x=\"51\" y=\"0\" width=\"583\" height=\"250\"></rect></clipPath><clipPath class=\"axesclip\" id=\"clip83f037y\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"30\" width=\"654\" height=\"167\"></rect></clipPath><clipPath class=\"axesclip\" id=\"clip83f037xy\"><rect x=\"51\" y=\"30\" width=\"583\" height=\"167\"></rect></clipPath></g><g class=\"gradients\"></g><g class=\"patterns\"></g></defs><g class=\"bglayer\"><rect class=\"bg\" x=\"51\" y=\"30\" width=\"583\" height=\"167\" style=\"fill: rgb(22, 27, 34); fill-opacity: 1; stroke-width: 0;\"></rect></g><g class=\"draglayer cursor-crosshair\"><g class=\"xy\"><rect class=\"nsewdrag drag\" data-subplot=\"xy\" x=\"51\" y=\"30\" width=\"583\" height=\"167\" style=\"fill: transparent; stroke-width: 0; pointer-events: all;\"></rect><rect class=\"nwdrag drag cursor-nw-resize\" data-subplot=\"xy\" x=\"31\" y=\"10\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"fill: transparent; stroke-width: 0; pointer-events: all;\"></rect><rect class=\"nedrag drag cursor-ne-resize\" data-subplot=\"xy\" x=\"634\" y=\"10\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"fill: transparent; stroke-width: 0; pointer-events: all;\"></rect><rect class=\"swdrag drag cursor-sw-resize\" data-subplot=\"xy\" x=\"31\" y=\"197\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"fill: transparent; stroke-width: 0; pointer-events: all;\"></rect><rect class=\"sedrag drag cursor-se-resize\" data-subplot=\"xy\" x=\"634\" y=\"197\" width=\"20\"